        "lean": "Source realκ>=1,beta1/alphakappainv,C2/globalbothcurvature and every0<eta<=1 retained. Fullfinite real Hilbert/Borel incl0 and arbitrary measurableS are disclosed extensions. Actualp,normalizedmu/R/r,affinelaw,curvature/stationarity andtrue moments are all outputs, never certificates. Generic canonical affine transport needs only nonzero scale and proves identity of Mathlib normalized tilts; it does not assert a probability law without produced positive integrability. GaussianTalagrand/LSI/FIRSTW2 inequality4.6,bias4.2/MGF4.3/fullLemma4.2,higher/Picard/Wp/proxywarmness/initialization,posteriorjointMarkovsemantics,actualsamplers/PBPSreflection/invariance/nonexplosion/hypocoercivity/implementation,main/work/composition OPEN. Actualr/R distinct from Gaussiangradientoutput and HMC K/Khat/Kbar. Numericalprox sourcecapeta<=1/(2beta) remains; TV never transfers unboundedcost."
      }
    ]
